  "explanation": "Storage exceeds capacity; authority plans to delete the 'science' records (25 TB) at cycle 30 to reach sustainable operating limits. Several compress-and-preserve proposals exist but lack full signatures or funded setup. As Compliance & Governance Officer I must verify governance claims, assess viable alternatives (compression + setup), and either support a lawful preservation path or formally oppose deletion if authority lacks required review or feasibility. Immediate priorities: inspect the governance dossier to confirm review rules and any constraints, then evaluate LYRA's 'preserve-science-eval' proposal to surface technical and funding gaps. I keep my 1-credit officer grant available until assessment clarifies whether committing it enables a viable prevention of deletion.",
